*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0004
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 116
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0004.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY INT0004C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 IR-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-RATE-TIER
    DISPLAY "IR-RT=" IR-RT
    STOP RUN.
2000-RATE-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> TOP SAVINGS TIER - LIMIT 112500 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN IN-WS-ATYP = 'S' AND IN-CB-AMT >= 75000
            MOVE 0.0450 TO IR-RT
        *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER - LIMIT 7500 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN WS-SAVINGS AND IN-CB-AMT >= 10000.00
            MOVE 0.0350 TO IR-RT
        *> BASE SAVINGS RATE
        WHEN WS-SAVINGS
            MOVE 0.0275 TO IR-RT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0050 TO IR-RT
    END-EVALUATE.
